# SHELL FLASH: the bright core of a cannon shell's impact (with shell_blast.pfx; one puff, GameProjectileComponent::destroy):
# a few big, short-lived additive sprites that grow as they fade. The bloom takes it.
ParticleEffect ShellFlash
	Emitter Flash
		Texture Textures/Particles/spark.dds
		Rate 0
		Burst 3
		SpawnRadius 0.2
		Offset 0, 0.5, 0
		ConeAngle 180
		Speed 0.0 0.5
		Life 0.12 0.2
		Gravity 0.0
		Drag 0.0
		Size 3.5 5.0
		SizeVariance 0.2
		ColorStart 20.0, 40.0, 50.0, 1
		ColorEnd 4.0, 10.0, 14.0, 0
		Additivity 1
		FadeIn 0.01
		FadeOutStart 0.2
		SoftFade 0.2
